#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:154
msgid ""
"Rework color-tracking code to pass color thresholds to ``find_blobs()`` / "
"``find_markers()`` and iterate the flat blob-tuple list (:ref:`the "
"find_blobs rewrite <v1_4_0_findblobs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Refaça o código de rastreamento de cor para passar limiares de cor a "
"``find_blobs()`` / ``find_markers()`` e iterar a lista plana de tuplas de "
"blob (\\ :ref:`a reescrita do find_blobs <v1_4_0_findblobs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"Read centroid / orientation / pixel data from the blob tuples instead of the"
" removed standalone methods (:ref:`the removed image methods "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`)."
msgstr ""
"Leia os dados de centroide / orientação / pixels das tuplas de blob em vez "
"dos métodos autônomos removidos (\\ :ref:`os métodos de imagem removidos "
"<v1_4_0_removed>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rename ``subimg`` → ``copy``, ``blit`` → ``replace``, fix ``blend()`` calls,"
" and replace ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (:ref:`the imlib renames "
"<v1_4_0_imlibrename>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renomeie ``subimg`` → ``copy``\\ , ``blit`` → ``replace``\\ , corrija as "
"chamadas de ``blend()`` e substitua ``scale`` / ``scaled`` / ``rainbow`` (\\"
" :ref:`as renomeações da imlib <v1_4_0_imlibrename>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.4.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"Rename ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (:ref:`the find_eye rename "
"<v1_4_0_findeye>`) and ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (:ref:`the compress"
" rename <v1_4_0_compress>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renomeie ``find_eyes()`` → ``find_eye()`` (\\ :ref:`a renomeação do find_eye"
" <v1_4_0_findeye>`\\ ) e ``compress()`` → ``compressed()`` (\\ :ref:`a "
"renomeação do compress <v1_4_0_compress>`\\ )."

